{
  "version": "0.9.29",
  "notes": "Authoritative local XemAi agent inventory, honest self-inspection and complete recent release history. Direct questions about agents and releases answer from current settings and code roles, not unrelated third-party web searches. Internal supervised self-audits now receive true application/release evidence; unrequested external research is suppressed, unrelated model comparisons rejected, and repeated off-target answers receive bounded factual fallback. Technology Watch rankings require actual priority analysis and a conditional evaluation plan. Tests passed on Windows/Linux. No new independent agents or privileges, code self-edits, downloads, model retraining or XemTV 114/115 modifications. Retains chats, memory, user-enabled AI Technology Watch and hybrid pairing.",
